OL,3,GNEWSAMan attempts 62 mile run-up to
OL,4,Abowl a cricket ball
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cricketer is attempting to break the
OL,7,FGuinness World Record for the longest
OL,8,Fever run-up prior to bowling a match
OL,9,Fball.
OL,11,FSam Bodoano, from Worplesdon, near
OL,12,FGuildford, will cover 62 miles (100km),
OL,13,Fstarting at Lord's Cricket Ground in
OL,14,Fnorth London at midnight on Saturday.
OL,16,FHe will complete the challenge by
OL,17,Fdelivering the first ball at Valley End
OL,18,FCricket Club (VECC) in Woking at 14:00
OL,19,FBST on Sunday, with the attempt raising
OL,20,Fmoney for UK cancer charity The Ruth
OL,21,FStrauss Foundation.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
