OL,3,GNEWSAMan attempts 62 mile run-up to
OL,4,Abowl a cricket ball
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I saw a video of the current record
OL,7,Fholder, who managed 24km (15 miles),
OL,8,Fand thought, 'I've got to give this a
OL,9,Fgo'," said Bodoano.
